# MockMate AI — Custom Model Training Pipeline
# ================================================
# This folder contains everything needed to train
# your own AI model from MockMate's collected data.
#
# Structure:
#   data/           → Exported training data (JSONL)
#   scripts/        → Training & export scripts  
#   models/         → Your fine-tuned model output
#   dashboard.html  → Monitoring dashboard
#
# Requirements:
#   - Python 3.10+
#   - Google Colab (free GPU) OR local GPU with 8GB+ VRAM
#   - At least 500 training samples from MockMate
#
# Quick Start:
#   1. Collect data: Use MockMate → data auto-saves to MongoDB
#   2. Export data:  python scripts/export_data.py
#   3. Train model:  Upload train_model.ipynb to Google Colab
#   4. Deploy model: ollama create mockmate-ai -f Modelfile

*.pyc
__pycache__/
models/*.bin
models/*.safetensors
models/*.gguf
models/content/
*.gguf
*.zip
data/*.jsonl
.env

node_modules/
.vercel/
dist/
build/
.env.local
